        "note": "Doc 49 unit CC.8. Q-49-25: the Dray keeps dual-mode lasers, starting in offence, so a sealed mind's Dray answers fire (R-47-2). Her screen is a hauler's: two rotaries alone let one round of a salvo in two through at range, unless she puts her lasers in defence and gives up her answer. A hull with no fit of its own flies this one."
